  "deny": [
    "openai/*"
  ],
  "_note": [
    "This registry is CONTROLLER-OWNED and is the only source of model family /",
    "vendor identity. A project profile may name ids from here; it can never",
    "declare a family, because that would let a profile manufacture reviewer",
    "independence.",
    "",
    "The openrouter/* ids below are a curated starting set and are NOT verified",
    "against OpenRouter's live catalog -- model ids there change. Validate an id",
    "before relying on it (`ai-opencode models` resolves families; a bad id fails",
    "at the provider, not silently). Add or remove entries freely: that is the",
    "intended way to extend the pool.",
    "",
    "vendor_family is what makes cross-vendor review independence meaningful.",
    "Two openrouter models from the same vendor are NOT independent reviewers."
  ]
}
